2px_rgba(31,77,46,0.06)]"><div class="mb-5 flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center text-3xl">📱</div><h4 class="mb-2 font-serif text-lg font-medium tracking-[-0.015em] text-neutral-900">Ready to share</h4><p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-neutral-500">Downloadable PDF, easy to share via WhatsApp, email, or direct link.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="px-6 py-12"><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[1240px] overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] bg-neutral-900 px-8 py-20 text-center text-white sm:px-12"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute left-1/2 top-[-200px] h-[500px] w-[900px] -translate-x-1/2" style="background:radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(74, 124, 90, 0.35), transparent 65%)"></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" style="background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0, transparent calc(8.333% - 1px), rgba(255,255,255,0.02) calc(8.333% - 1px), rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 8.333%)"></div><h2 class="relative font-serif text-[clamp(32px,5vw,56px)] font-medium leading-none tracking-[-0.035em] text-white">Your document.<!-- --> <span class="font-normal italic text-brand-light">Now.</span></h2><p class="relative mx-auto mt-4 max-w-[480px] text-base text-white/70">30 seconds for a professional PDF. From €1.</p><a href="#categories" class="relative mt-9 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-brand-light px-8 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-deep transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-white">Choose my task<!-- --> →</a></div></section></main></div><footer class="border-t border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50/60"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1240px] px-6 py-14 lg:px-8"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-10 md:grid-cols-5 mb-10"><div class="col-span-2 md:col-span-2"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5" href="/"><img alt="SnapTask" loading="lazy" width="36" height="36" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="logo-tint" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fs